## Reality Check

Multiple analyses published after the March 2025 prediction found that AI adoption in programming accelerated dramatically through tools such as:

- <Product>Claude Code</Product>
- <Product>GitHub Copilot</Product>
- <Product>Cursor</Product>

However, there is no evidence that 90% of all code globally became AI-generated within the predicted timeframe. Human engineers continue to play critical roles in architecture, review, testing, security, deployment, and business decision-making. 【11-43006a】【12-a7b352】【13-63c1d6】

